    parts: [
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.direct, '', [
        'The cervical length scan measures your cervix using an internal ultrasound, usually done around the same time as your anomaly scan, between 18 and 22 weeks. It checks whether your cervix is shorter than expected, which can be linked to a higher chance of preterm birth, so catching it early allows for monitoring or treatment.',
