      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'If your cervix measures short, your doctor may discuss options such as hormone treatment, activity adjustments, or in some cases a supportive stitch, all aimed at helping the pregnancy continue safely for longer. A normal length is simply reassuring and needs no further action.',
