        'In the second trimester, a common general guideline is gaining roughly half a kilogram (about 1 pound) per week, though your specific healthy range depends on your pre-pregnancy BMI. Gaining faster or slower than this occasionally isn\'t automatically concerning; your doctor tracks your overall pattern over several visits, not any single week.',
