    question: 'What does amniotic fluid do for my baby?',
    category: 'Baby Development',
    applicability: 'All trimesters',
    canI: 'Not applicable',
    sensitivity: 'No',
    parts: [
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.direct, '', [
        'Amniotic fluid is the fluid surrounding your baby in the womb, and it does far more than simply cushion them. It protects against bumps and pressure, allows room to move and grow, helps regulate temperature, and your baby actually swallows and breathes small amounts of it, which supports lung and digestive development.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.why, '', [
        'Movement within this fluid lets your baby\'s muscles and joints develop properly, something that would be far more restricted without it. Swallowing small amounts also helps your baby\'s digestive system practice functioning before birth, while inhaling tiny amounts supports the lungs in preparing for that first real breath after delivery.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'There\'s nothing specific you need to do to maintain healthy fluid levels beyond staying well hydrated and attending your routine scans, where fluid levels are checked as part of your baby\'s overall wellbeing. Too much or too little fluid are things your doctor watches for at these visits, though this is uncommon.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.doctor, '', [
        'Ask your doctor if you\'d like your amniotic fluid level explained at your next scan; it\'s a routine part of what\'s checked.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.perspective, '', [
        'It\'s a quietly beautiful detail that your baby is, in a real sense, swimming, drinking, and breathing this fluid, all as ordinary parts of getting ready for the world.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'Cushions your baby and allows room to move and grow.',
        'Helps regulate temperature inside the womb.',
        'Your baby swallows and inhales small amounts of it.',
        'This supports digestive and lung development.',
        'Fluid levels are checked routinely at your scans.',
      ]),
    ],
    related: [
