        'Use mosquito nets, repellents considered safe in pregnancy, and eliminate standing water around your home; stick to safe food and water practices, especially during monsoon season when mosquito-borne illness rises. Report any fever promptly to your doctor rather than waiting it out, since early diagnosis makes a real difference with these specific infections.',
