      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Breast pads, disposable or washable, can help if leaking feels noticeable or uncomfortable. Avoid deliberately expressing or stimulating your breasts to collect colostrum at this stage, since nipple stimulation this early isn\'t recommended; that\'s a specific, doctor-guided practice only considered later in pregnancy for particular situations.',
